{"3607440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A.A.U. Black Site", "steam_appid": 3607440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Gamescom 2026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/e23719c66c93f0bf42e9a72e9572452f.avif?t=1787750870\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras_big/e23719c66c93f0bf42e9a72e9572452f.avif?t=1787750870 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Betrayal in Uzovnica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been framed. Now, there’s no turning back. As a highly trained unit stranded in enemy territory, it’s imperative to push over your limit and get out of there ALIVE. Through your journey, you will find out what led to these unforeseen events. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/16025f8d392d43f11fe997ef64008e55.poster.avif?t=1787750870\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/16025f8d392d43f11fe997ef64008e55.webm?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/16025f8d392d43f11fe997ef64008e55.mp4?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bodycam-Infused Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bodycam is still recording, capturing every moment of your assignment. From the mundane... to the supernatural. A.A.U. Black Site combines realistic visuals, found-footage aesthetics designed to deliver an immersive journey through multiple levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/780b3fb561d9ed609a11cbc68f43d9a2.poster.avif?t=1787750870\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/780b3fb561d9ed609a11cbc68f43d9a2.webm?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/780b3fb561d9ed609a11cbc68f43d9a2.mp4?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finish the Mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They think you are weak. Prove them wrong. Check every corner and stay alert in this intense first-person  gunplay where you are the prime target. Remember, there are not many left in these lands who can watch your six.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/cbe8d4f460a65081044565e6f7057637.poster.avif?t=1787750870\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/cbe8d4f460a65081044565e6f7057637.webm?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/cbe8d4f460a65081044565e6f7057637.mp4?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >20+ Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an array of over 20 weapons, including but not limited to assault rifles, sub-machine guns and pistols. Go tactical or go loud; the choice of loadout is yours. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/920a9589c1d04c63479a910bb64f790f.poster.avif?t=1787750870\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/920a9589c1d04c63479a910bb64f790f.webm?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/920a9589c1d04c63479a910bb64f790f.mp4?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The initial release includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- God’s Chosen (a Demon) - Available at launch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guilt Trip - Available at launch<br>‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future scenes will be released over the coming months:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beneath the Rotten Sky - Coming soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- TBD (To be decided)<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/3767866d0984f7ddb1cc8308c7f194f0.poster.avif?t=1787750870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/3767866d0984f7ddb1cc8308c7f194f0.webm?t=1787750870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Betrayal in Uzovnica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been framed. Now, there’s no turning back. As a highly trained unit stranded in enemy territory, it’s imperative to push over your limit and get out of there ALIVE. Through your journey, you will find out what led to these unforeseen events. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/16025f8d392d43f11fe997ef64008e55.poster.avif?t=1787750870\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/16025f8d392d43f11fe997e